<h2 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px">Verify your email</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Hi <%= firstName %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px">Enter this code in <%= app.name %> to finish creating your account. It expires in <%= minutes %> minutes.</p>
<p style="font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;margin:24px 0;color:#c94f7c"><%= code %></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#666;font-size:13px">If you didn't sign up for <%= app.name %>, you can ignore this email.</p>
